    inApp: 'Find one pot of money you have already set aside — a savings account, a pension, a jar, anything. Write down two sentences about it. First: am I being paid for WAITING, for CARRYING UNCERTAINTY, or for neither? Second: what question was I answering when I put it there — do I need this to still be here next month, or am I willing for it to move in exchange for the chance that it grows? If you cannot answer the second one, you have found the most useful thing this lesson can give you, and it costs nothing to fix.',
