        body: 'A woman who had been through a very lean stretch and then a comfortable one said the lean years had made her pray constantly and the comfortable ones had made her forget to, and that nobody had ever warned her about the second one. She said she had been braced her whole life against the poverty half of that verse and had walked straight into the fullness half without recognising it, because it did not feel like a danger. It felt like relief. She said she reads the whole prayer now rather than the half of it she used to.',
